WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.997
LOOK. Compare fresh bread and visibly mouldy bread (pictures only).

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:08.707
SMELL. Show a warning symbol for an unusual odour, no sniffing test.

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:13.075
STORE. Compare covered cool storage with exposed hot storage.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.513
DECIDE. Mark suspected spoiled food as not safe to taste.
